nt account shall not prevent the client from selling securities and receiving its proceeds or profits on the investment account or transferring funds from his bank account to his investment account.","language":"en","languageLabel":"الإنجليزية"}],"imageGallery":[]}],"wordForms":[],"search":"تجميد الحساب الاستثماري  Freezing the Investment Account  The temporary block on all money transfers from the investment account, the utilisation of its balance, and the transfer or pledge of securities in the investment portfolios linked to it. The freezing of the investment account shall not prevent the client from selling securities and receiving its proceeds or profits on the investment account or transferring funds from his bank account to his investment account.","nonDiacriticsLemma":"تجميد الحساب الاستثماري","metaData":{"periodDateFrom":null,"periodDateTo":null},"lammaDetails":[{"form":"تجميد الحساب الاستثماري"}],"autoGeneratedRoot":null,"entryRelations":[],"dynamicProps":[]}}
